OL,3,AHuntingdon train attacker found guilty
OL,4,Aof seven counts of attempted murder
OL,5,
OL,6,FAnthony Williams - who stabbed
OL,7,Fpassengers on a train between
OL,8,FPeterborough and London in 2025 - has
OL,9,Fbeen found guilty of seven counts of
OL,10,Fattempted murder
OL,12,FWilliams, 33, stabbed 10 people on an
OL,13,FLNER service on 1 November last year
OL,15,FIn total, he denied 14 counts of
OL,16,Fattempted murder, including alleged
OL,17,Fattacks away from the train, in
OL,18,FPeterborough and London
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
